<concept id="t00091">
	<title id="e00652">Reclining seatback</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e00653">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e00654">
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/OOV025007_2.eps" align="center" height="1.740in" placement="break" id="e00655"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>To recline the seatback:</p>
		<ol>
			<li>
				<p>Push the control switch forward or rearward to move the seatback to the desired angle.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Release the switch once the seat reaches the desired position.</p>
			</li>
		</ol>
	</conbody>
